{"purpose":"Arsitektur target avior v0.x — struktur Go CLI universal Laravel, diturunkan dari review simpskba dan keputusan arsitektur terkait.","content":"LAYERING (Go):\ncmd/ — cobra wiring tipis; tanpa policy domain.\ninternal/brand — brand contract (Name, HostsMarker, StateDir, CANickname, ArchivePrefix) [adr:brand-contract].\ninternal/detect — prerequisite check generik.\ninternal/discovery — service discovery evidence-driven (Horizon/Scheduler/Reverb/Vite) — dipertahankan dari simpskba, diperluas lintas project.\ninternal/env — SATU parser .env untuk seluruh tool (menghabiskan duplikasi 3x simpskba); quoted/escaped safe untuk secret [H6].\ninternal/executor — Runner subprocess argumen-list + sanitasi secret + Writer io.Writer injectable.\ninternal/setup — alur setup sebagai step-pipeline (bukan 2 blok development/production); pilihan DB driver; manifest opt-in [adr:conventions-plus-optin-manifest].\ninternal/runtime dipecah (god package simpskba): \n  internal/processgroup — registry proses identity-checked + privilege + signal.\n  internal/trust — TrustManager CA per-OS (caddy trust authoritatif, NSS, keychain).\n  internal/proxy — Caddy path resolver + Caddyfile generator + port selection.\n  internal/hostname — /etc/hosts marker-managed.\n  internal/state — state runtime keyed per-project [adr:per-project-runtime-state].\ninternal/archive — distribusi; fungsi murni (tanpa mutasi global).\ninternal/ui — leaf: style, progress, cards.\n\nKONSTRUKSI TETAP (dari review): fail-closed consent; tanpa shell interpolation; identity-checked kill; checksum-verified supply chain termasuk binary Caddy (H3); writer injection konsisten; tipe Mode tunggal (habiskan validasi string di 6 tempat).\n\nMASA DEPAN: service identity bertipe (ServiceSpec bawa Role) menggantikan string-matching alias map; multi-project monitor di atas state per-project.\n\nLarangan arsitektur: tidak ada literal nama tool di luar internal/brand; tidak ada parser .env kedua; tidak ada state global lintas project."}